window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Witches are vanishing. A ghost won’t shut up. And a vampire has her in his sights. Welcome to Bayou Belle. Something dark is stirring in Bayou Belle—and Pepper Boucher is caught in the middle of it.</p> <p>Young witches from Graves Parish are disappearing without a trace, and no one knows why. Pepper doesn’t have the answers, but she’s damn sure going to find them—even if it means risking her own life.</p> <p>As if that’s not enough, her longtime nemesis has turned up dead, and the ghost refuses to leave Pepper alone. Add in a dangerously sexy vampire who’s shadowing her every move, and things are spiraling from bad to cursed.</p> <p>Ancient prophecies. Blood-soaked secrets. And a power rising from the swamp that could destroy everything.</p> <p>Can Pepper solve the mystery before she becomes the next witch to vanish?</p>"; 
